      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "When a person, charged with a grave offence, has been acquitted at a stage, has the intermediate acquittal 7 of 9 Neutral Citation No:=2024:PHHC:097558 CRM-M-43352-2023 - 8- pertinence to a bail plea when the appeal before this Court pends?"
